  "title": "Squash Casserole",
  "description": "This squash casserole makes a rich, creamy vegetable side dish. Stuffing mix may be used in place of bread crumbs if you prefer. Great for leftovers!",
  "authors": [
    "Gayle A Cox"
  ],
